# bhedojjivanam sub-project: raw scan sources kept local-only per machine
# (large PDFs/PNG page renders used for OCR verification; not needed once
# transcription is complete — only the derived .md working files are tracked)
sub-projects/bhedojjivanam/BJ_working/*.pdf
sub-projects/bhedojjivanam/BJ_working/*.png
sub-projects/bhedojjivanam/BJ_working/pilot/
